# Python caches and local environments
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Generated strategy data. Keep Markdown templates and documentation.
#
# ⚠️ **必须带 `**/` 前缀**。含 `/` 的模式在 gitignore 里是**锚定仓库根**的，
# 所以 `01_data/**` 拦不住 `<任意目录>/01_data/**`。2026-08-07 实际出过事：
# 一个基线脚本把测试助手的 tmp_path 实参写成了字符串 "2026-07-16"，
# 于是在**仓库根**建出 `2026-07-16/01_data/trades/master_trade_ledger.csv`
# 并被 `git add -A` 提交（那次是合成 fixture，没泄露真数据 —— 但同类事故
# 若写的是真实台账就是账户数据外泄）。
01_data/**
**/01_data/**
!01_data/**/
!**/01_data/**/
!01_data/**/*.md
!**/01_data/**/*.md

# Generated review reports (may contain sensitive account data). Keep directories only.
04_reviews/trade_review/**
!04_reviews/trade_review/**/
04_reviews/weekly/**
!04_reviews/weekly/**/

# Pipeline logs and transient output
06_logs/
03_daily_plans/_supporting/
03_daily_plans/*_daily_report.md
03_daily_plans/*_1445_review.md
04_reviews/daily/*_final_review.json
04_reviews/daily/*_final_review.md
# 同上：这些也要能拦住嵌套位置的误写
**/04_reviews/daily/*_final_review.json
**/04_reviews/daily/*_final_review.md
**/03_daily_plans/*_daily_report.md
**/03_daily_plans/*_1445_review.md
**/06_logs/
07_tools/_debug/
*.log
*.tmp
~$*

# Local editor and OS files
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# AI session exports (hundreds of MB, may contain account/holdings content)
/chat*.json
*.session.json
*-session-export*.json

# Coverage artifacts
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# agent 遗留的临时标记文件（17:00 agent 习惯产物，非代码无读者）
07_tools/trades/_no_trades_*.json
